WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.589
Property managers, be honest.

00:02.858 --> 00:05.296
Your dumpster has become the hottest club in town.

00:08.076 --> 00:09.736
And every complaint rings your office.

00:13.093 --> 00:19.111
With Loaded Valet Trash, residents set the can outside the door, bag inside, extra bag on top. Never a loose bag on the ground.

00:19.191 --> 00:22.674
Our porters pick up at every opted-in door, Monday through Friday evenings,

00:23.578 --> 00:25.470
straight to your compactor, same night.

00:26.236 --> 00:28.814
Residents opt in through your office, billed with rent.

00:28.995 --> 00:29.599
Move-outs?

00:32.708 --> 00:35.266
Party or event cleanup? We handle that too.

00:36.671 --> 00:40.866
Loaded Valet Trash. Call two two nine. five nine five. eight eight five two.
